             '- Days late: ' + str(days) + ', band ' + band[4] + ', persuasion attempts allowed: ' + str(band[3]) + '.',
             '- Deadline: ' + spoken_date(deadline) + ' (' + deadline.isoformat() + '). A promise date must be a business day from today to the deadline.',
