        b.append('- Full amount too much (offer once): I can record ' + money(fl) + ' for your ' + label + '. The rest stays overdue. Can you pay that?')
        b.append('- Amount below the floor: I cannot record less than ' + money(fl) + ' for your ' + label + '. Could you pay ' + money(fl) + '? The rest stays overdue.')
